  tenTranh: "Tranh d\xE2n gian \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 Ti\u1EBFn T\xE0i"
  moTa: " Xu\u1EA5t x\u1EE9: T\u1EEB l\xE0ng tranh d\xE2n gian \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3
    (Thu\u1EADn Th\xE0nh, B\u1EAFc Ninh), \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ngh\u1EC7 nh\xE2n s\xE1ng
    t\xE1c ri\xEAng \u0111\u1EC3 treo c\u1EEDa d\u1ECBp T\u1EBFt c\u1ED5 truy\u1EC1n.\n
    \xDD ngh\u0129a: C\u1EA7u ch\xFAc ti\u1EC1n t\xE0i n\u1EA3y n\u1EDF, c\u1EE7a
    c\u1EA3i \u0111i v\xE0o nh\xE0 v\xE0 mang l\u1EA1i s\u1EF1 gi\xE0u sang, ph\xFA
    qu\xFD cho gia ch\u1EE7.\n"
